  "scientific_conclusion": [
    "The finite 16-member empirical-rank sampler changes the V63 q99.9 physical moment by at most 4.01% relative to the 64-point Gauss-Hermite expectation. This is below the frozen 10% materiality threshold and cannot explain the sealed development failure.",
    "The train-only sub-Mpc pair diagnostic is instead strongly domain dependent: it underpredicts TNG100 correlations, is close for SIMBA, and overpredicts Swift correlations.",
    "The coefficient-scaled pair-score output gradient is 5.34 times the bounded-NLL gradient and is nearly orthogonal to the tail gradient. A marginal tail-only replacement therefore lacks a causal path to the remaining structure error.",
